  m_text: "Article 1 (Collection and use of personal information)\n\u2018Mitopia\u2019
    (hereinafter referred to as the service) collects and uses personal information
    to provide a suitable usage environment for users. We strive to protect personal
    information in accordance with relevant laws and regulations, such as the Information
    and Communications Network Act. The protection and use of personal information
    is subject to the company's privacy policy.\n\nArticle 2 (Personal information
    items collected and collection methods)\nPersonal information that is automatically
    collected in the process of using application services within a smart device
    may include information such as terminal information, IP address, cookies, visit
    date and time, illegal use records, service use records, and location information.\n\nArticle
    3 (Purpose of collection and use of personal information)\n\n1. We use the information
    collected from the service for the purposes of providing, maintaining, protecting,
    and improving the service, developing new services, and protecting the company
    and users.\n\n2. If you contact the company, we will keep a record of your communication
    to help resolve the problem you are experiencing. Notices may be used to provide
    service-related information, such as planned changes or improvements."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
